WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.101
Three pages here.

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:06.283
Training builds revision like a football session: warm up, main work, cool down.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.142
Explore is for when you are curious and want to go further than the lesson.

00:00:11.142 --> 00:00:17.944
Future shows where each subject can lead, such as A levels, T levels, apprenticeships and sport pathways.

00:00:17.944 --> 00:00:21.053
It connects school to the things you care about.

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:24.033
Try it now: open Future and look at one route.

